@dec22_szymczyk
# prose-audit: Grade C — The launcher, the concealment and the institutional-prestige question are staged with a locked oversight route; the officers in the building are described rather than heard.
title: The Commander fires a gift indoors
subtitle: A grenade launcher goes off inside Police Headquarters and the report changes twice
face-image: img/poland/events/jaroslaw-szymczyk-2018.webp
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
Q.dec22_szymczyk_done = 1;
Q.police_trust = Math.max(
    0, (Number(Q.police_trust) || 50) - 10
);
Q.institutional_trust = Math.max(
    0, (Number(Q.institutional_trust) || 0) - 4
);
Q.office_misuse_salience =
